<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Verbundbrief</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1396</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Verbundbrief was the constitution of the city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cologne">Cologne</a> adopted in 1396 after the overthrow of the patrician government. It gave political power to 22 corporations called Gaffeln, largely based on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guild">guilds</a>, which elected the city council. It remained in force, with amendments, until the French occupation in 1797.</p></div>
